        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Note: Up to 5 unused days at the end of each year can be carried to the next following year. Employees on PTO hired before the effective date of the 2005 contract will have until December 31, 2005 to use any 2004 carryover PTO days. Effective January 1, 2006, employees carrying over prior year's PTO will be required to use the carryover balance by August 31 of that following year. The combined total of new PTO days, plus the carry over PTO days cannot exceed the annual maximum PTO days.",
